step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple best_single strategy with FT_rf to see if a single top model beats the trimmed_mean pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full pool; this adds a robust weighted scheme that may beat the single best model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple median combination on the most stable pool1 to see if a robust median outperforms best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the slightly larger pool2 to see if adding the extra model improves over median pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a dba (data‑aware blending) on pool2 to see if it improves over existing weighted and median approaches.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the larger pool3 to see if it beats the best single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the most stable pool1 to see if it improves over median and trimmed_mean on that pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing meta‑model weights (w1) on the larger pool3 to see if it improves over the current best single FT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w1","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a tighter trim on pool2 to see if trimming fewer extremes improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool2","trim_pct":0.1}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean on pool3 with a higher trim_pct to see if trimming more improves over the current best weighted w2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool3","trim_pct":0.3}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean on the smaller, most stable pool1 with a larger trim to see if aggressive trimming improves over the current best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.3}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on pool3 to see if a different algorithm beats the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

